v 3
d cge -- Computable general equilibrium (CGE) modelling in Stata
d
d Builds, calibrates and solves static, single-country CGE models
d from a social accounting matrix, using Stata and Mata: CES or
d Cobb-Douglas value added, CET exports, Armington imports,
d households, government, savings-investment and the rest of the
d world, with selectable closures and built-in validation checks.
d
d Requires: Stata 13 or later
d Author: Mustapha Wasseja
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261012
d
f ado/cge.ado
f ado/cge.sthlp
f ado/_cge_load.ado
F ado/cge_mata.mata
f ado/cge_sam.ado
f ado/cge_sam.sthlp
f ado/cge_map.ado
f ado/cge_map.sthlp
f ado/cge_calibrate.ado
f ado/cge_calibrate.sthlp
f ado/cge_closure.ado
f ado/cge_closure.sthlp
f ado/cge_shock.ado
f ado/cge_shock.sthlp
f ado/cge_solve.ado
f ado/cge_solve.sthlp
f ado/cge_results.ado
f ado/cge_results.sthlp
f ado/cge_check.ado
f ado/cge_check.sthlp
f ado/cge_synthetic.ado
f ado/cge_synthetic.sthlp
F data/cge_synthetic_sam.csv
F data/cge_synthetic_sam_na.csv
F data/cge_synthetic_sam_inst.csv
F data/cge_synthetic_sam_margins.csv
F data/cge_synthetic_sam_tc.csv
F data/cge_synthetic_sam_mp.csv
F data/cge_synthetic_sam_cnm.csv
